HB0226 License plate-search and rescue council.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Campbell, K, Allemand, Guggenmos,
Haroldson, Kelly, Posey, Strock, Tarver, Williams and
Winter and Senator(s) Boner
AN ACT relating to motor vehicle license plates; authorizing specially designed
license plates to be issued to benefit search and rescue efforts; specifying
requirements; authorizing fees; making conforming amendments; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
